  "title": "Purse Enhancement Partnerships increase purses on Hall of Fame Weekend; Partnership with CertainTeed, SRS and JTR Roofing, Inc. adds $3,500 to each race July 25",
  "summary": "Canterbury Park corporate partners CertainTeed, SRS and JTR Roofing, Inc. will add $3,500 to each purse on the eight-race program Saturday, July 25. A total of $31,000 will go directly to purses on the Hall of Fame Weekend. The Saturday card includes the Ralph Strangis, Minnesota Turf Distaff and Mr. Dale Filly & Mare Turf […]",
